WEBVTT

00:10:59.996 --> 00:11:01.996
in commercial sex:

00:11:01.996 --> 00:11:03.996
condom use rates are between 80 and 100 percent

00:11:03.996 --> 00:11:06.996
in commercial sex in most countries.

00:11:06.996 --> 00:11:09.996
And, again, it's because of an alignment of the incentives.

00:11:09.996 --> 00:11:11.996
What's rational for public health

00:11:11.996 --> 00:11:13.996
is also rational for individual sex workers

00:11:13.996 --> 00:11:16.996
because it's really bad for business to have another STI.

00:11:16.996 --> 00:11:18.996
No one wants it.

00:11:18.996 --> 00:11:20.996
And, actually, clients don't want to go home with a drip either.

00:11:20.996 --> 00:11:23.996
So essentially, you're able to achieve

00:11:23.996 --> 00:11:26.996
quite high rates of condom use in commercial sex.

00:11:26.996 --> 00:11:28.996
But in "intimate" relations

00:11:28.996 --> 00:11:30.996
it's much more difficult because,